# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RideAhead configuration
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local     (PowerShell: copy .env.example .env.local)
#
# Then fill in the values below. .env.local is gitignored — keep real keys
# there and never in this file.
#
# Nothing here is required to start: with RIDEAHEAD_DEMO=1 the app serves
# bundled sample rides and calls no API at all. Add keys to go live.
#
# Check your setup at any time with:  npm run check
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# --- Mode ------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1 = bundled Boulder sample rides, no network calls, no keys needed.
# 0 = live. Requires ORS_API_KEY below.
RIDEAHEAD_DEMO=1


# --- Routing (the one key worth getting) -----------------------------------
# Free, no card: https://openrouteservice.org/dev/#/signup
# Sign up, then copy the "Basic Key" from account.heigit.org/manage/key
# Paste the raw key — no quotes, no "Bearer" prefix.
#
# Without this, routing falls back to the public OSRM demo server, which only
# has a car profile and returns no elevation. The app says so in the UI.
ORS_API_KEY=


# --- Street-level photography (optional, free) -----------------------------
# https://www.mapillary.com/dashboard/developers -> Register an application
#   Scopes: READ only — this app never writes or uploads.
#   Redirect URL is required by the form but unused here: http://localhost:3000
# After registering, copy the CLIENT TOKEN. It starts with "MLY|".
#
# This is what turns the flythrough from illustrations into real photographs.
# Mapillary covers bike paths, towpaths and trails Street View never drove,
# which is the whole point for cycling.
MAPILLARY_TOKEN=


# --- Street View (optional, PAID — billed per image) -----------------------
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/street-view-image-backend.googleapis.com
# Best quality where it exists. The free metadata endpoint gates every
# billable request, so no image is fetched without confirming coverage first.
# Leave blank unless you specifically want it.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=


# --- Map tiles (optional) --------------------------------------------------
# Blank = OpenStreetMap raster tiles, no key needed. Fine for local
# development, but the OSM tile usage policy rules out real traffic — set a
# MapTiler key before putting this in front of anyone.
# Free tier: https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_KEY=


# --- Etiquette -------------------------------------------------------------
# Nominatim and Overpass both ask that you identify your app with real contact
# details. Put your own email here before making significant use of them.
RIDEAHEAD_USER_AGENT="RideAhead/0.1 (you@example.com)"
